capability objects/delete-many  up to a thousand objects deleted in one request, any number in several
  heroes  s3.delete_objects, s3.NotDeleted
  go      s3.Client.DeleteObjects
  rust    aws_sdk_s3::Client::delete_objects
  python  S3.Client.delete_objects
  note    Quiet, so only the refusals are answered; `Content-MD5` is sent, where botocore 1.44.6 sends a CRC-32 (measured), and MinIO accepts it; minio-go RemoveObjects, RemoveObjectsWithResult, RemoveObjectsWithIter; rust-s3 delete_objects

capability objects/copy  an object copied on the server, its metadata kept or replaced
  heroes  s3.copy_object, s3.copy_object_with
  go      s3.Client.CopyObject
  rust    aws_sdk_s3::Client::copy_object
  python  S3.Client.copy_object, S3.Client.copy
  note    A refusal S3 answers with 200 is a failure; minio-go CopyObject, CopyDestOptions, CopySrcOptions; rust-s3 copy_object_internal

capability objects/tags  an object's tags read, set and removed
  heroes  s3.get_object_tags, s3.put_object_tags
  go      s3.Client.GetObjectTagging, s3.Client.PutObjectTagging, s3.Client.DeleteObjectTagging
  rust    aws_sdk_s3::Client::get_object_tagging, aws_sdk_s3::Client::put_object_tagging, aws_sdk_s3::Client::delete_object_tagging
