  note    Tags removed are `put_object_tags` with none; minio-go GetObjectTagging, PutObjectTagging, RemoveObjectTagging; rust-s3 get_object_tagging, put_object_tagging, delete_object_tagging

capability objects/checksums  CRC-32, CRC-32C, CRC-64/NVME, SHA-1 and SHA-256 sent with an object and checked on reading it
  heroes  s3.Checksum, s3.checksum_of, s3.format_checksum, s3.parse_checksum
  go      s3.GetChecksumValidationMetadata, s3.GetComputedInputChecksumsMetadata, s3.ChecksumValidationMetadata, s3.ComputedInputChecksumsMetadata, types.ChecksumAlgorithm, types.ChecksumMode
  rust    aws_sdk_s3::config::Builder::request_checksum_calculation, aws_sdk_s3::config::Builder::response_checksum_validation
  python  botocore.config.Config(request_checksum_calculation=, response_checksum_validation=)
  note    A checksum of an object uploaded in parts (`-` and a count) is not checked, since it is no checksum of the bytes read; minio-go NewChecksum, NewChecksumString

